{"version":1,"content":"<p>亞馬遜旗下Ring正進一步深入監控領域，推出一款用於家庭監控的室內無人機，以及一款旨在為企業巡邏的自主機械人。該公司周二發佈了售價250美元的Ring Drone Cam。這是一款安防攝像頭，可以從一個房間飛到另一個房間，包括樓上，並可在白天或夜間拍攝畫面。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585830.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.758128+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:54:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"32fb5368ed23e853e50446f0ae48e778f9b8601613ce20c84bf6f9834b4ffd5e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}